<view class="page feature-page points-mall"><brand-header back="{{true}}" title="积分商城"></brand-header><view class="pad"><view class="points-mall-balance panel"><view><view class="muted small">当前美丽积分</view><view class="points-mall-number">{{points}}</view></view><button class="more" bindtap="pointsHistory">积分明细<ui-icon name="chevron" size="23"></ui-icon></button></view><button class="personal-link panel" bindtap="goFlash"><view><text>积分秒杀日</text><view class="card-note">每周 / 每月 · 纯积分专场</view></view><ui-icon name="chevron" size="25"></ui-icon></button><view class="feature-tabs"><button class="feature-tab {{tab === 'gifts' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="gifts" bindtap="changeTab">礼遇好物</button><button class="feature-tab {{tab === 'records' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="records" bindtap="changeTab">兑换记录（{{records.length}}）</button></view><view wx:if="{{tab === 'gifts'}}"><view class="points-gift panel" wx:for="{{offers}}" wx:key="id"><view class="points-gift-photo"><media-placeholder src="{{item.image}}" label="礼品图片" fit="aspectFit" blank="{{true}}" kind="product"></media-placeholder></view><view class="points-gift-copy"><view class="points-gift-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="card-note">{{item.description}}</view><view class="points-gift-cost">{{item.cost}}<text> 积分{{item.cashPrice ? ' + ¥' + item.displayCash : ''}}</text></view></view><button class="points-redeem" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="redeem" disabled="{{item.redeemed || !item.enough || submitting}}">{{item.redeemed ? '已兑换' : item.enough ? '立即换购' : '积分不足'}}</button></view></view><view wx:else><view class="points-record panel" wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id"><view class="between"><text class="points-gift-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="pill">{{item.status}}</text></view><view class="between points-record-meta"><text>-{{item.cost}} 积分</text><text>{{item.date}}</text></view><view class="card-note">{{item.kind === 'point-flash' ? '积分秒杀 · 无需现金' : item.cashPrice ? '积分＋现金换购' : '积分商城'}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.status === '待付款'}}" class="more" bindtap="goOrders">查看待付款订单</button></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!records.length}}"><view class="empty-title">还没有兑换记录</view><text>选一份喜欢的礼遇好物吧</text></view></view><view class="notice">每款礼品限兑换1次。积分与兑换记录已接入本机后台。现金部分仅生成演示订单，真实支付与礼品履约未接入。</view></view></view>
